<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 13-14.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 13-14.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>13-14. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 13-14	 May 12-13</p>
<p> CZK	0.44504	    0.4435</p>
<p> DKK	2.10106	    2.10127</p>
<p> FIM	2.65193	    2.64845</p>
<p> HUF	0.07516	    0.07504</p>
<p> JPY	0.11407	    0.11419</p>
<p> LTL	3.39575	    3.36944</p>
<p> LVL     23.68673	   23.50733</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	    0.00234</p>
<p> SEK	1.176916	   1.76629</p>
<p> UAH	7.3682	     7.30716</p>
<p> USD     13.5796	    13.4744</p>
<p> XEU     15.56765	   15.53935</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
